│                        ││                                                                                                                │
│                        ││ I build infrastructure — tooling for AI coding agents, map servers, command-line tools, self-hosted platforms, │
│                        ││ and the hardware underneath them.                                                                              │
│                        ││                                                                                                                │
│                        ││ Seven independent projects carry this page: a deterministic code map for AI coding agents, a local-first       │
│                        ││ runner for those agents across machines, a self-hosted Mapbox alternative that was acquired in 2026, a static  │
│                        ││ Go binary for browserless file transfer, a private LLM and RAG platform on Kubernetes, a secure element board  │
│                        ││ for the Raspberry Pi, and a 3D-printing service that prices and fulfils uploaded parts.                        │
